Store graphics, not part of the package.

banner-516x252.jpg: the Jolla Store's optional "cover image for your Store
page" (516 x 252, from Jolla's 2013 developer announcement; the current
upload form was not checked). banner-1032x504.jpg: the same at double size.
Both cropped from cover art AI-generated with Grok (xAI) in October 2026
from a prompt written with the author, like qml/game/img/title-art.jpg.
SailfishOS:Chum has no banner field (icon and screenshots only).

screenshot-gameover-720x1600.png: the game over screen on the author's
Jolla C2 (native resolution), 2026-10-07. screenshot-gameover-540x960.png:
the same, centre-cropped to 9:16 and scaled to the 540 x 960 the Jolla
Store asked for in 2013. Taken before the fix that hides the level number
at game over (the faint "2" above the score).

screenshot-start-720x1600.png: the start screen in free flight on the
author's C2 (native), 2026-10-07. screenshot-start-540x960.png: the same
letterboxed into 540 x 960 (scaled to 432 x 960 on a dark navy canvas),
since a 9:16 crop would cut the title or ENGAGE.

screenshot-action-720x1600.png: idle mode in play on the author's C2,
level 5, score 24380, triple shot active, the UFO at the right edge;
chosen by the author from a burst of 20 (one every 3 s), unedited (the
first shot of the burst, so no "screenshot captured" note on it).
screenshot-action-540x960.png: the same, centre-cropped to 9:16.
